     "text": "Hello! I’m Wojciech, and I’m curious about how AI can change the way we learn and do business. After completing my Bachelor’s in Business Administration at Bamberg University, I’m now pursuing a Master’s in International Business, specialising in Supply Chain Management. My interests lie in supply chains, procurement, and AI. At DEXLab, I’m especially interested in exploring how agentic AI can support negotiations and how large language models can open up new possibilities in education and business.",
